      "summaries": {
        "en": "REBEL-large is a BART-based text-to-text model that extracts structured relationships from unstructured text, transforming messy natural language into clean triplets of entities and relations. Its key innovation is framing relation extraction as a sequence-to-sequence task, generating (subject, relation, object) triples directly from input sentences through end-to-end training. Researchers can use it via Hugging Face Transformers to build knowledge graphs from documents, analyze semantic networks in corpora, or fine-tune it for domain-specific relationship mining tasks.",
        "zh": "REBEL-large 是一个基于 BART 架构的文本到文本模型，专门从非结构化文本中提取结构化关系，将自然语言句子转换为清晰的（主体，关系，客体）三元组。其核心设计是将关系抽取重构为序列生成任务，通过端到端训练直接输出关系三元组，避免了传统流水线方法的误差传播问题。开发者可通过 Hugging Face 接口快速部署，用于从学术论文构建知识图谱、分析新闻中的事件关联，或针对特定领域（如生物医学文献）进行微调，实现自动化信息结构化。",
        "es": "REBEL-large is a BART-based text-to-text model that extracts structured relationships from unstructured text, transforming messy natural language into clean triplets of entities and relations. Its key innovation is framing relation extraction as a sequence-to-sequence task, generating (subject, relation, object) triples directly from input sentences through end-to-end training. Researchers can use it via Hugging Face Transformers to build knowledge graphs from documents, analyze semantic networks in corpora, or fine-tune it for domain-specific relationship mining tasks.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "rebel-large stands out for transformers, pytorch, and safetensors in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "REBEL-large is a BART-based text-to-text model that extracts structured relationships from unstructured text, transforming messy natural language into clean triplets of entities and relations. Its key innovation is framing relation extraction as a sequence-to-sequence task, generating (subject, relation, object) triples directly from input sentences through end-to-end training. Researchers can use it via Hugging Face Transformers to build knowledge graphs from documents, analyze semantic networks in corpora, or fine-tune it for domain-specific relationship mining tasks.",
          "how": "Review https://huggingface.co/Babelscape/rebel-large for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
